# Top Crystal Web Frameworks

A list of popular GitHub projects related to Crystal web framework (ranked by stars automatically).

Website: [crystal-web-framework-stars.vercel.app](https://crystal-web-framework-stars.vercel.app)

Please update [**list.txt**](list.txt) (via Pull Request)

<%= @list.size %> frameworks · <%= count_status("active") %> active · <%= count_status("stale") %> stale · <%= count_status("inactive") %> inactive

<sub>Status: 🟢 Active (commit within the last year) · 🟡 Stale (no commit for 1–3 years) · ⚫ Inactive (no commit for 3+ years)</sub>

| Project | Description | Stars | Forks | Issues | Status |
| :--- | :--- | :---: | :---: | :---: | :---: |<% @list.each do |item| %>
| [<%= item["name"] %>](<%= item["html_url"] %>) | <%= truncate_cell(item["description"].as_s) %> | <img height="20" src="https://img.shields.io/github/stars/<%= item["full_name"] %>?style=flat-square"/> | <img height="20" src="https://img.shields.io/github/forks/<%= item["full_name"] %>?style=flat-square"/> | <img height="20" src="https://img.shields.io/github/issues/<%= item["full_name"] %>?style=flat-square"/> | <%= status_label(item["activity_status"].as_s) %> |<% end %>

<sub><em>Last Automatic Update: <%= time %></em></sub>